---

Third-party assets bundled with this package keep their own licenses:

- Fonts in `assets/fonts/` — Phosphor Icons, MIT. The six TTFs come from
  `phosphor-icons/web` and the codepoints from `phosphor-icons/core`; the
  license text of each ships beside them, as `LICENSE-phosphor-web` and
  `LICENSE-phosphor-core`.
- `vendor/phosphor_icons.json` — the icon catalog from `phosphor-icons/core`,
  same MIT license as above, kept in-tree so the generator is reproducible.
